### Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "João da Silva",
    "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
    "senha": "senha123"
}

### Atualizar usuário
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/usuarios/6acf7c11b3d3823e83b4802e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Junior Martins Atual",
    "email": "juniora@gmail.com",
    "senha": "1234"
}

